{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1a434a87-90c1-854d-93ff-774389f6bce9",
  "created_at": "2026-01-17T11:06:19-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "David Burdick",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T11:03:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T11:03:52-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise, yeah, hi. Sorry to bother you, I know it's Saturday and City Hall's closed, so I wasn't sure anybody'd pick up this number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T11:04:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We've got the storm line staffed through the weekend when there's snow in the forecast. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T11:04:10-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. So I'm at 319 Bellevue Avenue, and I've got a question about the parking ban. When does it lift? I moved my car around the corner last night like a good citizen, and now it's, what, barely a dusting out there. Wicked cold, but hardly any snow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T11:04:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, it was a light one. Let me check where we are on that. Bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T11:04:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T11:04:37-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay. The ban stays in effect until the crews finish their passes on the main routes and the city lifts it. Bellevue is one of the routes they hit early, so I'd look for it to lift sometime this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T11:04:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This afternoon, okay. And when's it going to get cleared, like the street itself? Because I'm looking at it right now and it's, you know, a little white film over ice. It's not exactly a blizzard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T11:05:05-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They've already been through once on the main stretches overnight. With a dusting they'll mostly be salting and sanding because of the cold, so you may see a truck go by again in the next few hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T11:05:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm, so basically it's gonna be a few hours of me walking around the block for nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T11:05:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pretty much, I'm sorry. If the ban lifts, it goes out on the city's alerts and the website, so you can move the car back as soon as it does."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T11:05:37-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, okay. I'll keep an eye out. I just, I've got book club at two, and honestly I haven't finished the book, so I was hoping to get a few chapters in this morning instead of doing a car shuffle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T11:05:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the sooner you get back inside, the more pages you get. If it's icy in front of your place after the truck goes by, call us back and we'll send the sander."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T11:06:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Do you need my number for anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T11:06:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not for this. The address is enough if you call again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T11:06:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, perfect. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-17T11:06:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Stay warm, and good luck with the book."
    }
  ],
